Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Kahit siguro yung guhit sa drawing na yun, na chart na yun, wala pa rin.

asr-000317
00:47:13.360 --> 00:47:17.720
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Pero hindi po matutumbasan yung karangalang daladala ng ating mga...

asr-000318
00:47:17.820 --> 00:47:18.300
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: atleta.

asr-000319
00:47:18.720 --> 00:47:32.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: At masaya na rin po ako dahil with finality, nag-decide na po ang Supreme Court for this year na magagamit nyo na po yung naayon po sa batas sa NSDF na yung 5%.

asr-000320
00:47:32.980 --> 00:47:34.820
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Ay matatanggap nyo na po.

asr-000321
00:47:35.040 --> 00:47:36.660
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: So pakiusap ko lang po sa inyo.

asr-000322
00:47:36.760 --> 00:47:38.460
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Yan po yung pag-uusapan rin natin ngayon.

asr-000323
00:47:39.720 --> 00:47:42.060
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Sana gamitin nyo po ito sa ating mga atleta.

asr-000324
00:47:42.060 --> 00:47:47.700
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Gamitin nyo sa tama at walang maasayang na kahit na isang piso.

asr-000325
00:47:47.720 --> 00:47:49.360
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Diyan sa pondong yan.

asr-000326
00:47:49.980 --> 00:47:56.220
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: At gusto ko nga po itanong sa inyo mamaya na sana po kung kaya nyo bang i-cover po ang...

asr-000327
00:47:56.220 --> 00:47:58.840
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: lalong-lalo na po itong mga national athletes natin.

asr-000328
00:47:59.000 --> 00:48:04.720
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Kaya nyo naman siguro i-cover ang kanilang allowances, training, pamasahe.

asr-000329
00:48:06.060 --> 00:48:14.140
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Na hindi na sila na kailangang mangutang dyan para sa kanilang training.

asr-000330
00:48:14.580 --> 00:48:16.900
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Sinabi ko nga last week.

asr-000331
00:48:17.720 --> 00:48:29.120
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Na pag tuwing wala pong dumadamay sa kanila, ngunit pag nananalo sila, maraming sumasakay.

asr-000332
00:48:29.460 --> 00:48:31.720
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Pero pag training pa lang, walang sumasakay at walang nakikiramay.

asr-000333
00:48:33.000 --> 00:48:36.720
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Kailangan po natin ng pagmamalasakit po sa ating mga atleta.

asr-000334
00:48:38.480 --> 00:48:44.900
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: For next year, we hope that with the support of my colleagues, we can further add to the budget for sports.

asr-000335
00:48:44.960 --> 00:48:47.700
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Bukod sa financial assistance at support sa training.

asr-000336
00:48:47.720 --> 00:48:52.060
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: At sa ating mga atleta, mahalaga rin po ang moral support na ibinibigay sa kanila.

asr-000337
00:48:52.340 --> 00:48:57.780
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Malaking bagay po na maramdaman ang ating mga manlalaro na hindi sila nag-iisa sa kanilang laban

asr-000338
00:48:57.780 --> 00:49:02.440
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: at may kababayan silang patuloy na nininiwala at sumusuporta sa kanila.

asr-000339
00:49:02.960 --> 00:49:08.880
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Ang nakikita naman natin ang bunga ng ating patuloy na pagsusuporta sa ating mga atletang Pilipino.

asr-000340
00:49:09.400 --> 00:49:14.000
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Kaya naman patuloy natin isinasulong ang pagbibigay ng sapat na pondo at tulong

asr-000341
00:49:14.000 --> 00:49:17.320
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: sa pamamagitan ng Philippine Sports Commission o PSC

asr-000342
00:49:17.720 --> 00:49:22.720
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: para makasuportahan ang kanilang paghahanda at paglahok sa mga major international competitions.

asr-000343
00:49:23.400 --> 00:49:26.720
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Mahalaga rin po na magkaroon ng ating mga atleta ng maayos na training facilities,

asr-000344
00:49:27.720 --> 00:49:32.140
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: modernong kagamitan at sapat na pagkakataong mahasa ang kanilang kakayahan.

asr-000345
00:49:32.620 --> 00:49:37.720
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Kaya patuloy natin binibigyang pansin ang pagpapaunlad at rehabilitation ng ating sports facilities

asr-000346
00:49:38.320 --> 00:49:43.400
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: kabilang na po ang Rizal Memorial Sports Complex at Field Sports Complex

asr-000347
00:49:43.400 --> 00:49:50.110
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: upang magkaroon ang ating mga atleta ng ligtas, maayos at angkop na lugar para sa kanilang

asr-000348
00:49:50.120 --> 00:50:17.700
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: pagsasanay. At maalala ko po, nandito po si Senator Joel Villanueva during ah 2023 Championship. Ah champion kami non ha. first time. First uh first championship namin yon sa aming back to back nung 2024. Maalala niyo po naglaro tayo sa ah Ultra no Field Sports na po ngayon. tumulo yung malakas yung ulan may tulo sa gilid kaya sinulong natin

asr-000349
00:50:17.700 --> 00:50:47.680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: nagtulungan po kami rito nandito pa non si senator angara and of course ang ating ah former national athlete na si senator Joel Villanueva na para ma ma-repair po yung ah Field Sports at ah I'm sure baka tapos na po yung rehabilitation ng Field Sports sa ngayon at Rizal Memorial Coliseum rin po ah na maayos at komportable ang ating mga atleta pati

asr-000350
00:50:47.700 --> 00:51:17.680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: mga dormitoryo nila. Dapat maayos po na komportable rin po sila. At uh just recently na napanood ko at nakapaglaro rin po ako sa Ninoy Aquino Coliseum no. Sana wala na po yung tulo doon ah na malakas yung ulan na na na-stop po yung laro ng 1 hour sa PBA at nakapag-practice rin po kami diyan sa in fact last night nandon po ako sa napakaganda po na coliseum po itong

asr-000351
00:51:17.700 --> 00:51:47.680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Ninoy Aquino Coliseum. Sobrang lamig nga eh. Sabi ko, "Patayin niyo 'yung aircon. Hindi tayo pawisan 'yan." Sobrang lamig 'yung Ninoy Aquino. Mas malamig pa sa sa ibang mga coliseum. Napakaganda po. Ganda naman po 'yung ah meron lang po akong na-notice doun sa court ninyo. Merong tinatawag na dead spot. Pag ah pagdribble mo, alam ng

asr-000352
00:51:47.700 --> 00:52:17.680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: coach yun. Pag dribble mo nawala yung bola sa kamay mo kasi ma yung yung bounce niya dahil dead spot na at nahirapan ng habulin ni Senator Joel yung bola dahil sa edad na rin namin hindi na hindi na namin mahabol pagdribl mo. Anyway ah tingnan niyo lang po itong mga facilities niyo. Napakaganda po. Ah in fact gusto kong i-commend si ang PSCed by Chair Pato sa ginawa niyo po nung ah

asr-000353
00:52:17.700 --> 00:52:47.680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: WTA 125 Philippine Open sa tennis no. And next year dalawang competition po ang iho-host natin ' ba yung 125 at saka yung 250. nagawa po ng PS yan in 3 weeks na na-assemble nila yung ah tennis court at nakita ko na ah napakaganda po napakasaya at nakaka-proud po na mag-host tayo. Sana magkaroon pa tayo ng

asr-000354
00:52:47.700 --> 00:53:17.680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: mga hosting ng mga ganitong tennis competition lalo na ngayon with the tennis star Alex Iala ang namamayagpag sa buong mundo sa ah tennis uh field. Ah we also commend the initiative of the PSC to regionalize sports training centers. ang mga atleta nating nanggagaling sa iba't ibang sulok ng bansa. Maraming talento na maaaring makadiskubre kahit sa malalayong probinsya. Pero sa ang opisina ng PSC

asr-000355
00:53:17.700 --> 00:53:47.680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: nandito lang po sa Metro Manila at mga training centers natin karamihan nandito rin po sa Metro Manila. We want to bring our sports training centers nationwide para mabigyan ng sapat na atensyon ang ating mga atleta. For the 2026 budget, we push for the construction of the University of the Philippines, Mindanao Aquatic Center, ah high altitude sports facility in Baguio City and the Olympic Water Sports Training Facility in Siargao. At nananawagan rin po ang aking

asr-000356
00:53:47.700 --> 00:54:17.680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: mga kasamahan dito na sana po'y matuloy yung pag ah tatayo ng ah tennis sa ah stadium sa sa Clark. No, may lupa na kayo doon. Hopefully magiging uh uh may katuparan na po yang ating pangarap no dahil ah napakalaki rin po ng potensyal ng tennis sa ating bansa. We can produce uh more Alex Iala in the future.

asr-000357
00:54:17.700 --> 00:54:47.680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: At nauna na nating isinulong ang Republic Act number 11470. Kasama po si Senate President Win Gatsalan at mga kasamahan natin dito sa 18 Congress, Senator Joel Vill Nuueva na magkaroon po ng National Academy of Sports sa nuclear city na kung saan po'y meron pong pagkakataon ang ating mga student athletes na pagsasabayin po ang pagte-training at the same time mag-aral. Walang masasakripisyo dahil noon nasa sakripisyo ang pag-aaral pag

asr-000358
00:54:47.700 --> 00:55:17.680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: nagte-training. Nasa sakripisyo naman pagte-training pag sabay ang pag-aaral. Ngayon, pwede na pong pagsasabayin diyan po sa National Academy of Sports. Isa rin po tayo sa author at co-sponsor. Ngunit hindi lamang po gobyerno ang may responsibilidad sa pagpapaunlad ng Philippine Sports. Napakahalaga rin ng pakikilahok ng private sector. Dapat magtulungan po at mag-complement ang private and public sector sa pagbibigay ng financial assistance, ah sponsorships, training opportunities at iba pangailangan ng ating mga manlalaro.

asr-000359
00:55:17.700 --> 00:55:47.680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: During the recent committee on sports hearing, binigyan diin natin na ano man ang pagkakaiba hindi pagkakaunawaan po ng mga sports organizations, hindi dapat maapektuhan ang kapakanan ng ating mga atleta. Their welfare and development must always come first. We must also strengthen our commitment to national team participation and ensure better coordination so that

asr-000360
00:55:47.700 --> 00:56:17.680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: our best athletes can represent the country. in major international competitions. At pakiusap ko po muli sa ating ah PSC kung maari kayo po ang magpagitna sa pagkakaunawaan ah sa mga atleta at between their sports uh ah uh national sports association or NSAs. Aside from that, we also want to focus on sports tourism. Yun naman po ang prioridad ng ating PSC headed by

asr-000361
00:56:17.700 --> 00:56:47.680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: chairman Pato no. Napakaganda po ng Pilipinas sa totoo lamang po. Ah kahit ah una sa nananawagan po ako sa ating mga kababayan. Unahin niyo po ang pagtangkilik ng sariling atin. Umikot kayo sa buong Pilipinas at ah napakaganda po ng Pilipinas. And aside from that, ma-encourage natin yung mga turista na pumunta rito through sports na makikita nila napakaganda po ng Pilipinas. So napakaganda po ng inisyatiba ninyo na sports tourism.

asr-000362
00:56:47.700 --> 00:57:17.680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Nakita natin a study revealed that our hosting of the 2023 FIBA World Cup was beneficial for the country sa ating ekonomiya. Napakalaki po nito. Ah bukod dito naipakita natin ang husay at passion ng uh Pilipino sa larangan ng basketball. We also successfully hosted the FIVB volleyball men's World Championship last

asr-000363
00:57:17.700 --> 00:57:47.680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: year and earlier this year. We welcome the international tennis players for the inaugural WTA 125 Philippine Women's Open at next year. Excited na po tayong lahat. So malaking tulong po ito sa ating ekonomiya. Ito pong sports tourism. For 2027, the Philippines is preparing to host several major international sporting events including FIBA Women's Asia Cup in Cebu.

asr-000364
00:57:47.700 --> 00:58:17.680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: So ngayon po no, napansin ko pumupunta na rin po ang ating ah mga sporting events sa Cebu. At ah just recently meron pong maganda rin po yung kita niyo yung bagong arena ng SM doon sa Cebu. magagamit na rin po yon at ah mas mapo-promote pa natin ang kagandahan rin po ng ah Cebu. Maraming tourist destination po sa Cebu just across. Nandiyan na po yung ah Bohol.

asr-000365
00:58:17.700 --> 00:58:47.680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Uh the Philippines is preparing to host several major international competitions. Ito po yung sa FIBA Women's Asia Cup in Cebu, the World Wu Championships in Manila, the Inugural C+ Youth Games, the WTA 125 Philippine Women's Open and the new WTA 250 tournament among others. These international events provide an

asr-000366
00:58:47.700 --> 00:59:17.680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: opportunity to showcase the Philippines as a destination for world class sporting competitions. While promoting sports tourism, creating economic opportunities and inspiring more young Filipinos to pursue sports. We need a multi sectoral approach in hosting these kinds of events dahil napakalaki po ng benepisyo na maari nating makuha in hosting such events. I would also like to emphasize the importance of ensuring adequate and sustainable funding for

asr-000367
00:59:17.700 --> 00:59:47.680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Philippine sports development. In this regard, we want to make sure that the Supreme Court's decision which directed PAGCOR to account for and remit the full 5% of its gross. So ibig sabihin, ang decision na ito directed PAGCOR to account for and remit the full 5% of its gross annual income to the PSC as mandated under

asr-000368
00:59:47.700 --> 01:00:01.240
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Republic Act 6847 for the National Sports Development Fund or NSDF will be implemented faithfully. At pakiusap ko lang po

asr-000369
01:00:01.240 --> 01:00:11.400
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: sana po'y magamit ang bawat piso, bawat sentimo at maibalik po ito sa ating mga atleta at magamit po ito sa Philippine sports.

asr-000370
01:00:11.900 --> 01:00:19.180
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Mahalagang matiyak natin ang pondong itinakda ng batas para sa sports development ay talagang napupunta sa ating mga atleta at sports programs.

asr-000371
01:00:19.180 --> 01:00:29.000
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: We must ensure the proper implementation of the Supreme Court's ruling as well as transparency and accountability in the utilization of these funds.

asr-000372
01:00:29.000 --> 01:00:42.140
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: If we expect our Filipino athletes to consistently deliver outstanding performances and bring home medals from international competitions, we must also be willing to provide them with the necessary resources and support.

asr-000373
01:00:42.140 --> 01:00:51.480
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Hindi po pwedeng mataas ang ating expectations sa mga atleta pero kulang naman po ang pondong inilaan natin para sa kanilang paghahanda at pagsasanay.

asr-000374
01:00:51.940 --> 01:00:56.320
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Kaya mahalagang patuloy nating suportahan at dagdagan ang budget para sa sports.

asr-000375
01:00:57.100 --> 01:00:58.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Dito po si Sen. Joel Villanueva.

asr-000376
01:00:59.000 --> 01:01:07.500
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Isa rin po sa mga vice chairperson ng finance at mamaya si ating chair ng committee on finance, Sen. J.B.R. Sito.

asr-000377
01:01:08.180 --> 01:01:10.480
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Hingi po tayo ng tulong rin po sa kanila.

asr-000378
01:01:11.100 --> 01:01:17.420
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: In terms of legislation, we have already filed several significant measures to ensure continuity and progress.

asr-000379
01:01:17.960 --> 01:01:21.600
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: We must continue to champion the passage of the Philippine National Games.

asr-000380
01:01:24.720 --> 01:01:26.320
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Napirmahan ko na po yung comrep nito.

asr-000381
01:01:27.060 --> 01:01:28.400
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: At kung may isa batas po ito.

asr-000382
01:01:29.000 --> 01:01:34.180
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Nagkakaroon tayo ng mini Olympics every two years.

asr-000383
01:01:34.500 --> 01:01:44.360
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: We also filed Senate Bill 678 or the National Tertiary Games Act which seeks to formalize a national collegiate multi-sport tournament.

asr-000384
01:01:45.260 --> 01:01:54.620
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: As to the Games and Amusement Board, of course, we are also supportive of your endeavor in regulating sports professionals.

asr-000385
01:01:54.620 --> 01:02:00.420
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Ito po yung, ang trabaho niyo po ay regulating professional sports.

asr-000386
01:02:01.060 --> 01:02:05.500
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Nakita ko po yung inyong staff kagabi sa PBA.

asr-000387
01:02:06.340 --> 01:02:13.420
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Bawat laro ng PBA, nandoon po ang GAB at nagmo-monitor po sila.

asr-000388
01:02:13.520 --> 01:02:14.640
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Salamat po sa inyo.

asr-000389
01:02:15.500 --> 01:02:20.580
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: It is also important to ensure stringent processes in licensing professional athletes

asr-000390
01:02:20.580 --> 01:02:24.600
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: and physical safety in the conduct of professional athletes.

asr-000391
01:02:24.620 --> 01:02:33.620
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: We also ask the agency to strengthen efforts to prevent and combat illegal gambling and game-fixing in professional sports.

asr-000392
01:02:34.660 --> 01:02:35.600
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Sir, tingnan niyo po.

asr-000393
01:02:36.240 --> 01:02:38.040
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: May laro na po yung bakolod ba yun?

asr-000394
01:02:39.700 --> 01:02:43.120
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Ngayon ay i-re-raise po ni Senator Joel.

asr-000395
01:02:43.240 --> 01:02:45.720
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Tingnan niyo po yung mga game-fixing.

asr-000396
01:02:46.380 --> 01:02:47.000
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Alam niyo bakit?

asr-000397
01:02:47.440 --> 01:02:54.160
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Nakakaulang gaano manood ng basketball na alam na niluluto ng game-fixing na yan.

asr-000398
01:02:54.620 --> 01:03:00.380
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: So, importante po dito sa sports, makikita mo yung thrill ng laro.

asr-000399
01:03:01.520 --> 01:03:06.620
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Ako nga, pag nakikita mo ng tambak ka na, makikita mo yung mga fans, nag-uwi yan na.

asr-000400
01:03:07.220 --> 01:03:13.040
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Lalo na pag nakakita ng luto o game-fixing, mawalang gana.

asr-000401
01:03:13.820 --> 01:03:16.460
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Hindi po magiging successful yung liga.

asr-000402
01:03:16.600 --> 01:03:17.600
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Wala nang pong manonood.

asr-000403
01:03:17.720 --> 01:03:19.540
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Wala nang tatangkilik doon sa ligang yun.

asr-000404
01:03:19.540 --> 01:03:24.460
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Pag nakikita niyo merong game-fixing, I'm urging.

asr-000405
01:03:24.620 --> 01:03:30.840
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: I'm calling on the organizers, kung ano man po yung ligang yun, tutukan niyo.

asr-000406
01:03:30.900 --> 01:03:35.080
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: And of course, with the help of GAB, kayo naman po pwede mag-sanction, kayong pwede mag-suspend.

asr-000407
01:03:35.880 --> 01:03:38.940
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Tingnan niyo po ng mabuti yan, sir.

asr-000408
01:03:39.520 --> 01:03:47.640
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Itong sports, sabi ko, mas masarap ang pakiramdam mo pag pinaghirapan, pinagpawisan, at pinagpaguran niyo ang bawat panalo.

asr-000409
01:03:49.280 --> 01:03:51.300
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Nakakita ka ng mga game-fixing dyan.

asr-000410
01:03:51.940 --> 01:03:52.720
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Nakakaulang gana.

asr-000411
01:03:53.720 --> 01:03:54.540
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Sa totoo lamang po.

asr-000412
01:03:54.620 --> 01:04:02.220
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Wala na ako ng gana manonood na may mga larong luto o mga game-fixing.

asr-000413
01:04:03.180 --> 01:04:07.680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Maganda manonood yung talagang pantay at patas na laban.

asr-000414
01:04:07.680 --> 01:04:13.420
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: In closing, I just ask the PSC and GAB to fully utilize your budgets.

asr-000415
01:04:13.920 --> 01:04:19.760
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: I trust that you will continue to prioritize transparency and accountability in the use of public funds.

asr-000416
01:04:20.240 --> 01:04:23.580
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Let us work together to ensure that the funds are maximized.

asr-000417
01:04:23.580 --> 01:04:28.700
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: For the benefit of our athletes and the development of sports in the country.

asr-000418
01:04:29.440 --> 01:04:31.380
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Maraming salamat po.

asr-000419
01:04:31.860 --> 01:04:46.300
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: At let us now hear the opening statement of my colleague, Senator Joel, if you have any opening remarks.

asr-000420
01:04:47.020 --> 01:04:48.000
Senator Joel Villanueva: Thank you, Mr. Chairman.

asr-000421
01:04:48.280 --> 01:04:51.380
Senator Joel Villanueva: Such a pleasure to be here today.

asr-000422
01:04:51.380 --> 01:04:53.560
Senator Joel Villanueva: We welcome our friends from the Philippines.

asr-000423
01:04:53.580 --> 01:04:57.120
Senator Joel Villanueva: Sports Commission, from Games and Amusement Board.

asr-000424
01:04:57.280 --> 01:04:59.120
Senator Joel Villanueva: Maraming salamat po sa inyong pagdalo.

asr-000425
01:05:00.360 --> 01:05:03.160
Senator Joel Villanueva: Usually, nakikita lang namin pag budget hearing eh.

asr-000426
01:05:03.340 --> 01:05:05.520
Senator Joel Villanueva: Yung maraming ahensya ng pamahalaan.

asr-000427
01:05:05.640 --> 01:05:10.420
Senator Joel Villanueva: But unlike ang PSC, nakakausap naman po namin.

asr-000428
01:05:10.760 --> 01:05:17.820
Senator Joel Villanueva: And susugan ko lang yung sinabi ni Chairperson na Senator Bongo na maraming salamat.

asr-000429
01:05:17.820 --> 01:05:22.980
Senator Joel Villanueva: Kasi pinapaggamit niyo sa amin yung Nino yan, no? Brad?

asr-000430
01:05:23.580 --> 01:05:24.280
Senator Joel Villanueva: Ninoy Aquino.

asr-000431
01:05:24.560 --> 01:05:28.280
Senator Joel Villanueva: O kahit na sabi nga ni Senbong gumulong ako isang beses.

asr-000432
01:05:28.880 --> 01:05:29.620
Senator Joel Villanueva: De, biro lang po.

asr-000433
01:05:30.800 --> 01:05:39.180
Senator Joel Villanueva: Well, gusto ko kong sabihin na ang sports ay isa sa pinakamalapit na department sa akin.

asr-000434
01:05:40.620 --> 01:05:47.980
Senator Joel Villanueva: Primarily because I am literally pinakain at pinag-aral ng sports.

asr-000435
01:05:47.980 --> 01:05:52.600
Senator Joel Villanueva: I was an athletic scholar since high school to college.

asr-000436
01:05:53.580 --> 01:05:56.100
Senator Joel Villanueva: From the great University of Santo Tomas.

asr-000437
01:05:56.340 --> 01:06:00.620
Senator Joel Villanueva: And I once, twice represented the country in the international competition.

asr-000438
01:06:00.860 --> 01:06:07.340
Senator Joel Villanueva: I was part of the very first SEABA in 1994.

asr-000439
01:06:07.580 --> 01:06:12.140
Senator Joel Villanueva: That's the very first SEABA, Southeast Asian Basketball held in Johor, Malaysia.

asr-000440
01:06:12.140 --> 01:06:22.920
Senator Joel Villanueva: And then upon getting the title ng UAAP, we were sent to represent the University Association in the Philippines.

asr-000441
01:06:23.580 --> 01:06:29.360
Senator Joel Villanueva: In Taipei for another international competition.

asr-000442
01:06:29.900 --> 01:06:33.820
Senator Joel Villanueva: Kaya po, alam ko din ho yung hirap ng ating mga atleta.

asr-000443
01:06:33.920 --> 01:06:35.180
Senator Joel Villanueva: Alam ko rin yung mga challenges.

asr-000444
01:06:36.280 --> 01:06:40.820
Senator Joel Villanueva: Ma'am, ako yung fan po ninyo.

asr-000445
01:06:41.080 --> 01:06:42.740
Senator Joel Villanueva: Gulat ako, nakaharap ko pala ho kayo.

asr-000446
01:06:44.900 --> 01:06:47.240
Senator Joel Villanueva: Alam ko yung hirap, alam ko po yung pagod.

asr-000447
01:06:47.240 --> 01:06:51.740
Senator Joel Villanueva: Alam ko yung minibigay na oras, panahon ng mga atleta.

asr-000448
01:06:51.960 --> 01:06:53.240
Senator Joel Villanueva: Lalo na yung mga...

asr-000449
01:06:53.580 --> 01:06:56.780
Senator Joel Villanueva: Yung mga hindi po talaga blessed.

asr-000450
01:06:58.240 --> 01:07:04.420
Senator Joel Villanueva: At talagang sports yung kanilang tanging pag-asa para makaahon sa buhay.

asr-000451
01:07:04.620 --> 01:07:10.160
Senator Joel Villanueva: Hindi lamang just because they love the sports, but because this is their lifeblood.

asr-000452
01:07:11.540 --> 01:07:16.940
Senator Joel Villanueva: Kaya nakakalungkot po if you hear a lot of things, complaints, etc.

asr-000453
01:07:17.200 --> 01:07:21.900
Senator Joel Villanueva: And I would confess, I was a member of the House of Reps for nine years.

asr-000454
01:07:22.860 --> 01:07:23.160
Senator Joel Villanueva: I've been in...

asr-000455
01:07:23.580 --> 01:07:25.300
Senator Joel Villanueva: I've been in the Senate for about ten years now.

asr-000456
01:07:25.460 --> 01:07:26.920
Senator Joel Villanueva: So parang veteran na po ako.

asr-000457
01:07:27.700 --> 01:07:33.220
Senator Joel Villanueva: But I never really put myself into a position na talagang andun lang ako.

asr-000458
01:07:33.500 --> 01:07:35.020
Senator Joel Villanueva: I'm always at the outside.

asr-000459
01:07:35.660 --> 01:07:39.640
Senator Joel Villanueva: Kasi like in UST, just to share with you, sa UST for example,

asr-000460
01:07:40.260 --> 01:07:41.580
Senator Joel Villanueva: pag nakaalam ako doon sa...

asr-000461
01:07:42.140 --> 01:07:45.380
Senator Joel Villanueva: Of course, I played for UST for many years.

asr-000462
01:07:46.140 --> 01:07:49.100
Senator Joel Villanueva: Pag nakaalam ka doon sa basketball, kunyari doon sa coaching,

asr-000463
01:07:49.500 --> 01:07:52.060
Senator Joel Villanueva: may makakalabang ka isang paksyon, definitely ho yun.

asr-000464
01:07:52.060 --> 01:07:53.060
Senator Joel Villanueva: Walang pwedeng...

asr-000465
01:07:53.580 --> 01:07:54.920
Senator Joel Villanueva: Hindi ka may makakalaban.

asr-000466
01:07:55.000 --> 01:07:56.260
Senator Joel Villanueva: So may makakalaban ka lagi.

asr-000467
01:07:56.480 --> 01:07:59.180
Senator Joel Villanueva: So laging from the outside lang ho ako lagi.

asr-000468
01:07:59.320 --> 01:08:00.400
Senator Joel Villanueva: And ganoon din ho sa sports.

asr-000469
01:08:00.540 --> 01:08:04.440
Senator Joel Villanueva: Kasi talagang yung sports, grabe yung politics ever since.

asr-000470
01:08:04.820 --> 01:08:09.160
Senator Joel Villanueva: Hindi ko nalang ikukwento yung ilang karanasan ko, personal experience ko

asr-000471
01:08:09.160 --> 01:08:13.000
Senator Joel Villanueva: about the evils of sports politics.

asr-000472
01:08:13.420 --> 01:08:16.220
Senator Joel Villanueva: Gusto ko lang sabihin, nung nakaraang hearing,

asr-000473
01:08:16.220 --> 01:08:23.200
Senator Joel Villanueva: and I actually missed it because I have an equally important event,

asr-000474
01:08:23.580 --> 01:08:27.440
Senator Joel Villanueva: narinig po ng mga senador dito sa bulwagang ito,

asr-000475
01:08:27.520 --> 01:08:30.100
Senator Joel Villanueva: sa pangungunan ng aming chairperson, Senator Bong Go,

asr-000476
01:08:30.620 --> 01:08:34.620
Senator Joel Villanueva: yung hamon po sa paghahanda ng ating national teams.

asr-000477
01:08:35.120 --> 01:08:40.300
Senator Joel Villanueva: Mula po doon sa availability ng players, hanggang doon sa mga allowances nila,

asr-000478
01:08:40.880 --> 01:08:43.000
Senator Joel Villanueva: gastusin sa training, transportation.

asr-000479
01:08:43.820 --> 01:08:47.740
Senator Joel Villanueva: Hindi po dapat mangutang yung isang atleta para lang makapag-insayo

asr-000480
01:08:47.740 --> 01:08:49.200
Senator Joel Villanueva: at makapaglaro para sa bansa.

asr-000481
01:08:49.200 --> 01:08:52.460
Senator Joel Villanueva: In fact, that is the main reason na...

asr-000482
01:08:52.460 --> 01:08:53.540
Senator Joel Villanueva: I just got a text message...

asr-000483
01:08:53.580 --> 01:08:59.960
Senator Joel Villanueva: And then, I saw an article, an interview with Brian Bagunas.

asr-000484
01:09:00.100 --> 01:09:03.720
Senator Joel Villanueva: That very same day, I took the floor and delivered a privileged speech

asr-000485
01:09:03.720 --> 01:09:06.580
Senator Joel Villanueva: and raised this particular issue.

asr-000486
01:09:07.620 --> 01:09:10.580
Senator Joel Villanueva: In fact, I'm more than willing to push for...

asr-000487
01:09:12.000 --> 01:09:18.440
Senator Joel Villanueva: If we are not going to get good and clear answers from these personalities

asr-000488
01:09:18.440 --> 01:09:22.060
Senator Joel Villanueva: and, if I'm not mistaken, PNVF,

asr-000490
01:09:22.060 --> 01:09:26.260
Senator Joel Villanueva: We will call for an investigation here in the Senate

asr-000491
01:09:26.260 --> 01:09:32.820
Senator Joel Villanueva: if it is also right to ask the Senate Blue Ribbon Committee.

asr-000492
01:09:33.020 --> 01:09:33.720
Senator Joel Villanueva: We will do that.

asr-000493
01:09:34.280 --> 01:09:38.920
Senator Joel Villanueva: Ang point ko lang, hindi talaga ako magdadalawang isip na ipaglaban yung mga atlets.

asr-000494
01:09:39.020 --> 01:09:39.680
Senator Joel Villanueva: I've been there.

asr-000495
01:09:39.880 --> 01:09:42.800
Senator Joel Villanueva: I know what it's like to be an athlete.

asr-000496
01:09:42.920 --> 01:09:44.920
Senator Joel Villanueva: I know what it's like when you're not being supported.

asr-000497
01:09:44.920 --> 01:09:50.920
Senator Joel Villanueva: Pero yung sobra naman na yung mga nababalitaan mo na pinagkakakitaan,

asr-000498
01:09:51.660 --> 01:09:52.920
Senator Joel Villanueva: yung hihingi ng...

asr-000499
01:09:53.580 --> 01:09:56.440
Senator Joel Villanueva: International League para makakuha ng sponsors

asr-000500
01:09:56.440 --> 01:09:59.400
Senator Joel Villanueva: tapos hindi ibibigay sa atlets yung what's due them.

asr-000501
01:09:59.880 --> 01:10:03.560
Senator Joel Villanueva: So, you know, siguro, some of the questions that I will raise

asr-000502
01:10:03.560 --> 01:10:05.680
Senator Joel Villanueva: will be something to that effect.

asr-000503
01:10:06.180 --> 01:10:08.740
Senator Joel Villanueva: And, of course, for the PSC, we want to understand how

asr-000504
01:10:08.740 --> 01:10:12.520
Senator Joel Villanueva: your proposed budget and additional sports development funds

asr-000505
01:10:12.520 --> 01:10:15.580
Senator Joel Villanueva: will address these gaps.

asr-000506
01:10:16.060 --> 01:10:19.260
Senator Joel Villanueva: Mahalaga po yung paghahanda para sa international competitions.

asr-000507
01:10:20.260 --> 01:10:22.420
Senator Joel Villanueva: Sapat ba yung pangangalaga sa atlets?

asr-000508
01:10:22.540 --> 01:10:23.560
Senator Joel Villanueva: Taon-taon, time and again.

asr-000509
01:10:23.580 --> 01:10:26.400
Senator Joel Villanueva: Since I was a member of the House of Reps,

asr-000510
01:10:26.480 --> 01:10:29.380
Senator Joel Villanueva: yung support coming from PAGCOR, from PCS,

asr-000511
01:10:29.500 --> 01:10:30.880
Senator Joel Villanueva: o ewan ko kung nababalitaan nyo,

asr-000512
01:10:30.960 --> 01:10:34.000
Senator Joel Villanueva: lagi kong pinapound yan kasi hindi naman talaga nagagawa.

asr-000513
01:10:34.160 --> 01:10:34.560
Senator Joel Villanueva: Hindi ko ba?

asr-000514
01:10:34.760 --> 01:10:37.840
Senator Joel Villanueva: And for so long, kulang lagi yung binibigay nila.

asr-000515
01:10:38.300 --> 01:10:40.320
Senator Joel Villanueva: And it's already with the Supreme Court.

asr-000516
01:10:40.460 --> 01:10:42.360
Senator Joel Villanueva: And they had a decision already.

asr-000517
01:10:42.580 --> 01:10:45.140
Senator Joel Villanueva: And I'll go for it later, Mr. Chairman.

asr-000518
01:10:45.720 --> 01:10:46.780
Senator Joel Villanueva: And then, of course, sa GAB,

asr-000519
01:10:46.880 --> 01:10:49.240
Senator Joel Villanueva: nabanggit kanina ni Mr. Chairman yung

asr-000520
01:10:49.240 --> 01:10:53.460
Senator Joel Villanueva: unacceptable behavior ng Game Fix.

asr-000521
01:10:53.580 --> 01:10:59.660
Senator Joel Villanueva: Sabi ko nga, literal, na pinalaki at pinakain ako ng basketball,

asr-000522
01:11:00.160 --> 01:11:01.540
Senator Joel Villanueva: pinag-aral ng basketball.

asr-000523
01:11:01.680 --> 01:11:03.740
Senator Joel Villanueva: So maliit lang po yung basketball community.

asr-000524
01:11:04.220 --> 01:11:05.180
Senator Joel Villanueva: Maliit lang po yan.

asr-000525
01:11:05.960 --> 01:11:13.300
Senator Joel Villanueva: Mula doon sa intriga na sino yung inaalagaan ng mga politiko

asr-000526
01:11:13.300 --> 01:11:15.580
Senator Joel Villanueva: o may sponsor, sino yung...

asr-000527
01:11:16.420 --> 01:11:17.100
Senator Joel Villanueva: Alam mo yan eh.

asr-000528
01:11:17.200 --> 01:11:17.660
Senator Joel Villanueva: Alam mo yan.

asr-000529
01:11:17.900 --> 01:11:19.900
Senator Joel Villanueva: You know what I'm saying, Mr. Chairman.

asr-000530
01:11:20.460 --> 01:11:21.960
Senator Joel Villanueva: Lalo na yung Game Fixing.

asr-000531
01:11:21.960 --> 01:11:23.460
Senator Joel Villanueva: Lalo na yung Game Fixing.

asr-000532
01:11:23.580 --> 01:11:27.980
Senator Joel Villanueva: Including yung paggamit ng pinagbabawal na gabot,

asr-000533
01:11:28.280 --> 01:11:30.380
Senator Joel Villanueva: yung mariwana, yung cannabis.

asr-000534
01:11:31.560 --> 01:11:33.660
Senator Joel Villanueva: I'll touch it later, Mr. Chairman.

asr-000535
01:11:33.880 --> 01:11:37.120
Senator Joel Villanueva: Because if we want to take care really of our athletes,

asr-000536
01:11:37.380 --> 01:11:38.660
Senator Joel Villanueva: we have to do our job, no?

asr-000537
01:11:38.800 --> 01:11:42.660
Senator Joel Villanueva: So yung GAB, medyo gusto kong kunahin yan mamaya.

asr-000538
01:11:43.440 --> 01:11:45.880
Senator Joel Villanueva: Alam nyo naman kung gaano ako kasupportive sa inyo

asr-000539
01:11:45.880 --> 01:11:47.320
Senator Joel Villanueva: for the past so many years.

asr-000540
01:11:47.600 --> 01:11:50.020
Senator Joel Villanueva: Mga ambulansya nyo dyan, yung mga gamit nyo po dyan.

asr-000541
01:11:50.300 --> 01:11:53.020
Senator Joel Villanueva: The past 10 years, I have been supporting GAB.

asr-000542
01:11:53.580 --> 01:11:57.520
Senator Joel Villanueva: So gusto ko lang kung masuri kung ano yung mga pwede pa natin gawin.

asr-000543
01:11:57.620 --> 01:12:01.060
Senator Joel Villanueva: I'm not here to point fingers or blame anyone.

asr-000544
01:12:01.260 --> 01:12:04.640
Senator Joel Villanueva: Yung layunin po natin in this particular budget deliberation

asr-000545
01:12:04.640 --> 01:12:12.080
Senator Joel Villanueva: is to find out and assure the public na kakaya natin gagawin po natin

asr-000546
01:12:12.080 --> 01:12:16.460
Senator Joel Villanueva: para masiguro na yung bawat pondo na ilalaan po natin sa sports

asr-000547
01:12:16.460 --> 01:12:18.080
Senator Joel Villanueva: ay may malinaw na pakinabang.

asr-000548
01:12:18.080 --> 01:12:23.080
Senator Joel Villanueva: Hindi lang po sa ating mga atleta at sa kinabukasan ng Philippine sports.

asr-000549
01:12:23.580 --> 01:12:27.960
Senator Joel Villanueva: Panaming salamat Mr. Chairman and I'm ready to ask questions

asr-000550
01:12:27.960 --> 01:12:31.040
Senator Joel Villanueva: if you wish, Mr. Chairman. Thank you.

asr-000551
01:12:31.660 --> 01:12:38.820
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Salamat. Sinusuportahan rin po natin ang panawagan ni Senator Joel

asr-000552
01:12:38.820 --> 01:12:40.900
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: bilang isang atleta rin po.

asr-000553
01:12:41.280 --> 01:12:44.480
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Siya dati po siyang national athlete.

asr-000554
01:12:45.800 --> 01:12:50.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Alam nyo po ang kalakaran sa larangan ng sports.

asr-000555
01:12:50.980 --> 01:12:52.420
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Kaya sinabi ko parate.

asr-000556
01:12:53.580 --> 01:12:57.280
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Kala ko po na dito lang po sa Senado may politika.

asr-000557
01:12:57.900 --> 01:13:04.080
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: At rin po pala sa World of Sports ay may politika rin po.

asr-000558
01:13:04.260 --> 01:13:09.020
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Sana po walang politika sa sports.

asr-000559
01:13:09.660 --> 01:13:17.660
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Dapat po ay kung ano po yung karapatan at nararapat

asr-000560
01:13:17.660 --> 01:13:21.220
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: para sa ating mga atleta, dapat po ibigay sa kanila.

asr-000561
01:13:22.260 --> 01:13:22.500
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: So,

asr-000562
01:13:23.580 --> 01:13:28.260
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: yan po ang panawagan ko sa PSC. Full support naman po kami dito sa inyo parate.

asr-000563
01:13:29.220 --> 01:13:31.360
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Sana po ay matigil na po itong

asr-000564
01:13:31.360 --> 01:13:41.340
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: politika sa sports at mabigyan ng importansya at matutukan po ang ating mga atleta.

asr-000565
01:13:42.080 --> 01:13:44.480
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Pakinggan po natin ang ating PSC.

asr-000566
01:13:44.840 --> 01:13:50.160
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: To start off, we will first hear the budget presentations of the agencies

asr-000567
01:13:50.160 --> 01:13:53.380
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: and then we will open the floor for questions and discussion.

asr-000568
01:13:53.580 --> 01:13:56.740
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: So, let us hear first the presentation of PSC.

asr-000569
01:13:57.640 --> 01:14:01.240
Senator Joel Villanueva: Chairman, can I ask first how long would be the presentation?

asr-000570
01:14:01.920 --> 01:14:03.360
Senator Joel Villanueva: It's not going to take an hour, right?

asr-000571
01:14:04.360 --> 01:14:05.180
Senator Joel Villanueva: Thank you, thank you.

asr-000572
01:14:05.560 --> 01:14:05.880
Senator Joel Villanueva: Salamat.

asr-000573
01:14:06.060 --> 01:14:07.260
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: Mga 20 minutes siguro.

asr-000574
01:14:07.500 --> 01:14:08.820
Senator Joel Villanueva: Good, good. Thank you po.

asr-000575
01:14:09.220 --> 01:14:13.020
Senator Joel Villanueva: Because my next meeting is to meet our athletes also, Mr. Chairman.

asr-000576
01:14:13.200 --> 01:14:14.300
Senator Joel Villanueva: Thank you. Salamat po.

asr-000577
01:14:14.620 --> 01:14:15.440
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: Thank you, Senator.

asr-000578
01:14:16.800 --> 01:14:19.780
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Senator Joel, maglalaro ka ba mamaya?

asr-000579
01:14:21.420 --> 01:14:23.540
Senator Joel Villanueva: Kailangan ko bang sabihin dito na galing ako sa doktor?

asr-000581
01:14:23.580 --> 01:14:27.240
Senator Joel Villanueva: They found out naman there's a partial tear in my shoulder.

asr-000582
01:14:29.040 --> 01:14:30.400
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Injection na yata itong...

asr-000583
01:14:30.400 --> 01:14:31.300
Senator Joel Villanueva: I did, I did.

asr-000584
01:14:31.440 --> 01:14:32.700
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Everyday siya nagre-rehab.

asr-000585
01:14:32.700 --> 01:14:34.900
Senator Joel Villanueva: May basketball game po kami mamaya eh.

asr-000586
01:14:35.140 --> 01:14:37.280
Senator Joel Villanueva: Ang kakampi ko si Steph Curry ng Senado.

asr-000587
01:14:37.480 --> 01:14:40.340
Senator Joel Villanueva: So, we're blessed to have him in our team.

asr-000588
01:14:40.560 --> 01:14:43.660
Senator Joel Villanueva: It's just that unfortunately wala ko yung magpapasa sa kanya,

asr-000589
01:14:43.760 --> 01:14:45.580
Senator Joel Villanueva: yung favorite niyang tagapasa mamaya.

asr-000590
01:14:46.200 --> 01:14:47.700
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Sumakit na yung likod namin.

asr-000591
01:14:48.000 --> 01:14:48.620
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Iba talaga.

asr-000592
01:14:49.300 --> 01:14:53.320
Senator Joel Villanueva: So, every time nagagamit po namin yung court po ninyo.

asr-000593
01:14:53.580 --> 01:14:55.900
Senator Joel Villanueva: At at least alam mo namin yung pangangailangan nyo.

asr-000594
01:14:56.020 --> 01:14:57.520
Senator Joel Villanueva: Pagka hindi tumatalbog yung bola,

asr-000595
01:14:57.680 --> 01:14:58.580
Senator Joel Villanueva: pag may tumutulo,

asr-000596
01:14:59.260 --> 01:15:00.000
Senator Joel Villanueva: alalaman nyo...

asr-000597
01:15:00.000 --> 01:15:01.940
Senator Joel Villanueva: namin. Kung pwede lang ako mag-balling,

asr-000598
01:15:02.040 --> 01:15:03.880
Senator Joel Villanueva: ma'am, talagang wala.

asr-000599
01:15:04.640 --> 01:15:05.640
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Thank you, Mr. Chairman.

asr-000600
01:15:05.960 --> 01:15:07.760
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Sobrang lamig nung Ninoy Aquino

asr-000601
01:15:07.760 --> 01:15:09.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Coliseum ninyo. Napakaganda na

asr-000602
01:15:09.980 --> 01:15:11.840
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: ano na Coliseum.

asr-000603
01:15:12.340 --> 01:15:14.000
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: You can improve further.

asr-000604
01:15:15.040 --> 01:15:15.780
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Go ahead po, Chairman.

asr-000605
01:15:16.560 --> 01:15:17.820
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: Magandang hapon po,

asr-000606
01:15:17.940 --> 01:15:19.900
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: Chairman, Senator Bongko

asr-000607
01:15:19.900 --> 01:15:21.880
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: and Senator Joel. Sa lahat po

asr-000608
01:15:21.880 --> 01:15:23.660
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: ng mga kasama naming Commissioner sa

