asr-001531
01:47:04.580 --> 01:47:08.440
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: So, hiniwalay po ang Sports Commission sa education, naging deped, nahiwalay.

asr-001532
01:47:09.060 --> 01:47:18.000
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Do you think it's a high time or proper time na magkaroon tayo ng muli ng sarili nyo talagang

asr-001533
01:47:18.000 --> 01:47:23.220
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: departamento na, department level na sa sports natin?

asr-001534
01:47:23.220 --> 01:47:26.140
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Kasi sabi ko nga, tuwing nananalo tayo,

asr-001535
01:47:26.140 --> 01:47:30.400
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: yung karangalang daladala para sa ating bayan, napaka-laki po, no?

asr-001536
01:47:30.520 --> 01:47:34.600
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: We are very proud na manalo ating mga atleta.

asr-001537
01:47:35.120 --> 01:47:39.140
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: At importante rito, meron talagang nakatutok sa kanila na isang departamento,

asr-001538
01:47:39.820 --> 01:47:46.640
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: not only as ito pong commission lamang po, no?

asr-001539
01:47:46.660 --> 01:47:49.140
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Hindi ko naman minamalit yung commission, pero ibig sabihin,

asr-001540
01:47:49.260 --> 01:47:53.280
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: baka it's high time na mas mapalawak pa natin yung kapasidad ninyo.

asr-001541
01:47:54.260 --> 01:47:55.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Maybe we can study.

asr-001542
01:47:56.140 --> 01:47:57.260
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: It's here, no?

asr-001543
01:47:57.380 --> 01:47:58.520
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Through legislation.

asr-001544
01:47:59.100 --> 01:48:03.140
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: At kayo ba sangayon ba kayo kung sakasakali na kailangan ba ng isang departamento

asr-001545
01:48:03.660 --> 01:48:07.700
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: para mas matutukan nyo po ang ating mga atleta?

asr-001546
01:48:08.100 --> 01:48:09.020
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Panapapanahon na ba?

asr-001547
01:48:09.600 --> 01:48:11.920
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Kasi, for example, my fellow...

asr-001548
01:48:11.920 --> 01:48:17.840
Senator Joel Villanueva: You should study that really in-depth study because my next question would be

asr-001549
01:48:17.840 --> 01:48:22.880
Senator Joel Villanueva: what would be the difference of having a commission and having a department.

asr-001550
01:48:22.880 --> 01:48:25.880
Senator Joel Villanueva: You have to convince us that...

asr-001551
01:48:26.140 --> 01:48:32.800
Senator Joel Villanueva: There is a big difference as to your operations when you become a department

asr-001552
01:48:32.800 --> 01:48:34.960
Senator Joel Villanueva: and what are expected of you.

asr-001553
01:48:35.200 --> 01:48:37.260
Senator Joel Villanueva: And more importantly, I think, Mr. Chairman,

asr-001554
01:48:38.000 --> 01:48:43.580
Senator Joel Villanueva: yung maganda na nabanggit ni Chairman Pato yung sa mga atletes,

asr-001555
01:48:43.680 --> 01:48:46.020
Senator Joel Villanueva: basta ikaw ay nag-represent ng Philippine team.

asr-001556
01:48:46.900 --> 01:48:51.660
Senator Joel Villanueva: Ikaw ay saklaw nitong atletes' benefits.

asr-001557
01:48:51.660 --> 01:48:53.500
Senator Joel Villanueva: So, ibig sabihin,

asr-001558
01:48:53.660 --> 01:48:54.660
Senator Joel Villanueva: yung...

asr-001559
01:48:54.660 --> 01:48:59.460
Senator Joel Villanueva: yun nga, yung mga atletes natin na nag-represent sa Asian Games,

asr-001560
01:48:59.580 --> 01:49:00.660
Senator Joel Villanueva: kasama po sila dyan.

asr-001561
01:49:01.000 --> 01:49:02.180
Senator Joel Villanueva: Until when?

asr-001562
01:49:02.260 --> 01:49:03.960
Senator Joel Villanueva: Gusto ko lang maintindihan, until when?

asr-001563
01:49:04.720 --> 01:49:05.820
Senator Joel Villanueva: By the duration?

asr-001564
01:49:06.020 --> 01:49:08.220
Senator Joel Villanueva: After the Asian Games?

asr-001565
01:49:08.340 --> 01:49:09.720
Senator Joel Villanueva: For instance, tapos na po yun?

asr-001566
01:49:09.860 --> 01:49:10.060
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: Opo.

asr-001567
01:49:10.620 --> 01:49:12.040
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: Ano ito po, Senator Joel?

asr-001568
01:49:13.280 --> 01:49:16.820
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: Nati-technical lang po kami because of our charter and our mandate.

asr-001569
01:49:17.260 --> 01:49:19.880
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: On the definition of professional athletes.

asr-001570
01:49:19.880 --> 01:49:23.040
Senator Joel Villanueva: So, because of that, hindi mo na susuportahan yung mga professionals?

asr-001571
01:49:23.100 --> 01:49:24.320
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: Yung professionals po.

asr-001572
01:49:24.320 --> 01:49:27.320
Senator Joel Villanueva: But the professionals supposed to be, they're, I mean, more...

asr-001573
01:49:28.340 --> 01:49:29.920
Senator Joel Villanueva: Diba? Mas marami na silang...

asr-001574
01:49:29.920 --> 01:49:30.300
Senator Joel Villanueva: Pondo.

asr-001575
01:49:30.560 --> 01:49:30.960
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: Pondo.

asr-001576
01:49:31.160 --> 01:49:31.440
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: Opo.

asr-001577
01:49:31.580 --> 01:49:32.840
Senator Joel Villanueva: But of course, it's not an excuse.

asr-001578
01:49:33.000 --> 01:49:35.720
Senator Joel Villanueva: I don't want to sound like we don't care about them.

asr-001579
01:49:35.820 --> 01:49:37.620
Senator Joel Villanueva: Of course, it's not an excuse.

asr-001580
01:49:37.700 --> 01:49:40.940
Senator Joel Villanueva: But ang point ko lang is, at least, lahat sila, no?

asr-001581
01:49:41.000 --> 01:49:42.440
Senator Joel Villanueva: Ngayon, tapos na yung Asian Games.

asr-001582
01:49:42.720 --> 01:49:43.320
Senator Joel Villanueva: Wala na ba yun?

asr-001583
01:49:44.500 --> 01:49:48.040
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: Tuloy-tuloy po yan para sa mga atleteng considered amateur.

asr-001584
01:49:48.600 --> 01:49:51.340
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: Tuloy-tuloy po yan as far as uniforms.

asr-001585
01:49:51.640 --> 01:49:53.340
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: Tuloy-tuloy po yan in terms of...

asr-001586
01:49:54.320 --> 01:49:55.400
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: Yung training nila abroad.

asr-001587
01:49:55.560 --> 01:49:56.960
Senator Joel Villanueva: Itay ko na to, chairman, no?

asr-001588
01:49:57.000 --> 01:50:00.160
Senator Joel Villanueva: Yung opportunity because I didn't make it during the hearing.

asr-001589
01:50:01.340 --> 01:50:06.040
Senator Joel Villanueva: Nag-usap na po kayo nung PNVF, yung pagbalik nyo nung Nagoya, diba?

asr-001590
01:50:06.100 --> 01:50:09.120
Senator Joel Villanueva: Let's just talk about specifics dito sa volleyball, no?

asr-001591
01:50:09.160 --> 01:50:11.660
Senator Joel Villanueva: Nagbigay na yung PSC ng transition report.

asr-001592
01:50:12.620 --> 01:50:17.040
Senator Joel Villanueva: Pwede malaman ano yung exactong napagkasundoan nyo nitong PNVF

asr-001593
01:50:17.040 --> 01:50:21.380
Senator Joel Villanueva: at ano yung maaasahan nating improvements ng ating mga atleta mula ngayon

asr-001594
01:50:21.380 --> 01:50:24.280
Senator Joel Villanueva: in terms of allowance, training, and other athletes.

asr-001595
01:50:24.320 --> 01:50:28.180
Senator Joel Villanueva: Kami po ni Sen. JV. We're very close to a lot of athletes.

asr-001596
01:50:28.540 --> 01:50:34.460
Senator Joel Villanueva: Sen. JV po ang isa sa mga pioneers nitong V-League.

asr-001597
01:50:34.500 --> 01:50:36.480
Senator Joel Villanueva: Is it V-League, Brad? Yung sa San Juan, no?

asr-001598
01:50:37.200 --> 01:50:42.560
Senator Joel Villanueva: So nandun kami, magkasama kami matagal na and we have talked to a lot of players,

asr-001599
01:50:43.160 --> 01:50:49.320
Senator Joel Villanueva: volleyball players, and we were surprised to hear a lot of complaints, a lot of...

asr-001600
01:50:49.800 --> 01:50:52.420
Senator Joel Villanueva: And of course, it's nothing to do with the Philippine Sports Commission,

asr-001601
01:50:52.420 --> 01:50:53.420
Senator Joel Villanueva: but you being the...

asr-001602
01:50:54.320 --> 01:51:01.260
Senator Joel Villanueva: the PSC, I think you can do a lot of things in addressing these issues.

asr-001603
01:51:01.600 --> 01:51:04.260
Senator Joel Villanueva: Madalas ho kasi, and I will say this with all humility,

asr-001604
01:51:04.860 --> 01:51:07.880
Senator Joel Villanueva: na madalas ho kasi ayaw natin makialam dahil,

asr-001605
01:51:07.960 --> 01:51:10.100
Senator Joel Villanueva: hindi, sila-sila na yan eh, problema nila na yan.

asr-001606
01:51:10.540 --> 01:51:13.440
Senator Joel Villanueva: Pero kung wala ho talagang makikialam, chairman,

asr-001607
01:51:14.040 --> 01:51:16.340
Senator Joel Villanueva: kawawa talaga yung mga atleta ho natin.

asr-001608
01:51:16.440 --> 01:51:19.660
Senator Joel Villanueva: We have seen this, you know, I am not an expert,

asr-001609
01:51:19.840 --> 01:51:22.220
Senator Joel Villanueva: especially when you talk about volleyball, I am not an expert.

asr-001610
01:51:22.220 --> 01:51:23.640
Senator Joel Villanueva: Until now, probably, I don't know.

asr-001611
01:51:24.320 --> 01:51:27.640
Senator Joel Villanueva: It's in volleyball, but yung mga naririnig ho namin,

asr-001612
01:51:27.780 --> 01:51:30.660
Senator Joel Villanueva: and just a personal experience, for instance,

asr-001613
01:51:31.020 --> 01:51:32.840
Senator Joel Villanueva: dun sa board nila, walang volleyball player,

asr-001614
01:51:33.000 --> 01:51:42.340
Senator Joel Villanueva: walang talagang tumututok para hanapin or alamin kung ano talaga yung nangyayari sa mga atleta.

asr-001615
01:51:42.940 --> 01:51:44.440
Senator Joel Villanueva: And yun, negosyo ba yun?

asr-001616
01:51:44.640 --> 01:51:46.100
Senator Joel Villanueva: It's a corporation now.

asr-001617
01:51:46.280 --> 01:51:49.080
Senator Joel Villanueva: Parang yun lang ho, it's a personal comment.

asr-001618
01:51:49.080 --> 01:51:54.160
Senator Joel Villanueva: Again, I'm not an expert, but it pains me a lot as a former athlete,

asr-001619
01:51:54.320 --> 01:51:58.280
Senator Joel Villanueva: atlet na, yun lang eh, yung maririnig mo na representing the Philippines,

asr-001620
01:51:58.420 --> 01:52:03.180
Senator Joel Villanueva: wala kang pang transportation, wala kang maayos na pagkain,

asr-001621
01:52:03.300 --> 01:52:07.000
Senator Joel Villanueva: and higit sa lahat, yung sinasabi ng mga players, first-hand information po,

asr-001622
01:52:07.640 --> 01:52:09.420
Senator Joel Villanueva: yung mga sinasabi ng players na,

asr-001623
01:52:09.520 --> 01:52:13.060
Senator Joel Villanueva: oy, yung sponsor daw, kailangan,

asr-001624
01:52:13.940 --> 01:52:18.300
Senator Joel Villanueva: kailangan huwag kang magsusuot ng, ano tawag ho doon, yung leggings.

asr-001625
01:52:18.800 --> 01:52:20.640
Senator Joel Villanueva: Dapat daw, walang leggings para kita legs.

asr-001626
01:52:20.640 --> 01:52:23.480
Senator Joel Villanueva: Things like that, nakakainit ho ng ulo eh.

asr-001627
01:52:24.320 --> 01:52:26.400
Senator Joel Villanueva: You know, I can go on and on.

asr-001628
01:52:26.480 --> 01:52:32.560
Senator Joel Villanueva: In fact, if we will push with the investigation in the Blue Ribbon Committee,

asr-001629
01:52:33.460 --> 01:52:37.660
Senator Joel Villanueva: pag nakuha ko lahat yung mga papeles na yan at mga testigo na yan,

asr-001630
01:52:37.800 --> 01:52:42.140
Senator Joel Villanueva: talagang patawag ho natin yung mga officials, raw information.

asr-001631
01:52:42.260 --> 01:52:45.620
Senator Joel Villanueva: That's why I don't want to divulge it right now, but it's really alarming.

asr-001632
01:52:45.880 --> 01:52:46.440
Senator Joel Villanueva: It's really alarming.

asr-001633
01:52:46.500 --> 01:52:49.820
Senator Joel Villanueva: And I'm only talking about volleyball here, I'm not talking about any other sports.

asr-001634
01:52:50.180 --> 01:52:51.060
Senator Joel Villanueva: Just to put that on record.

asr-001635
01:52:51.060 --> 01:52:54.280
Senator Joel Villanueva: So, Mr. Chairman, pwedeng malaman lang yung developments mo?

asr-001636
01:52:54.320 --> 01:52:59.200
Senator Joel Villanueva: With this particular NSA, itong PNVF, Mr. Chairman.

asr-001637
01:52:59.260 --> 01:53:00.600
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: Thank you, Senator Joel.

asr-001638
01:53:01.120 --> 01:53:06.960
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: Alam nyo po yung PNVF, nagkaroon talaga sila ng major issues dyan sa leadership.

asr-001639
01:53:07.780 --> 01:53:10.600
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: They, nakatatlong presidente na ho yan in 12 months.

asr-001640
01:53:11.580 --> 01:53:11.880
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: Opo.

asr-001641
01:53:12.380 --> 01:53:16.160
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: So, nakatatlong presidente sila in 12 months, palit sila ng palit ng signatory,

asr-001642
01:53:16.300 --> 01:53:21.760
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: palit sila ng palit ng programa, hanggang na, tinamaan na ho sila, inahabol po.

asr-001643
01:53:21.760 --> 01:53:23.760
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: But, we are...

asr-001644
01:53:24.320 --> 01:53:25.060
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: We are trying to solve that.

asr-001645
01:53:25.140 --> 01:53:27.240
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: As a matter of fact, tomorrow, I have a meeting with them.

asr-001646
01:53:27.820 --> 01:53:30.740
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: With the new president, with the officers, we have a meeting with them.

asr-001647
01:53:30.860 --> 01:53:34.040
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: Kasi kasama po sa tatalakayan namin yung mga unliquidated nila,

asr-001648
01:53:34.600 --> 01:53:39.200
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: na ginasto sila, na hindi nila naliliquidated, naliliquidate.

asr-001649
01:53:39.760 --> 01:53:40.540
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: Kasama po yan.

asr-001650
01:53:41.000 --> 01:53:44.200
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: So, bukas po, kamiting namin siyang bago presidente, Frank Lau.

asr-001651
01:53:44.660 --> 01:53:47.260
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: At nangako naman po siya na tutulungan natin sila.

asr-001652
01:53:47.260 --> 01:53:53.600
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: Pero, rinireview rin po namin, Senator Joel, yung definition talaga ng professionals.

asr-001653
01:53:54.080 --> 01:53:54.300
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: Ako,

asr-001654
01:53:54.320 --> 01:53:55.320
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: I'm with you, sir.

asr-001655
01:53:55.980 --> 01:53:59.900
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: There's a thin line that separates yung national team, tsaka yung professionals.

asr-001656
01:54:00.960 --> 01:54:06.780
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: Hindi naman ho lahat ng professionals, malaki ang sweldo katulad ng, let's face it, basketball.

asr-001657
01:54:07.820 --> 01:54:09.660
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: Let's face it, women's volleyball.

asr-001658
01:54:10.380 --> 01:54:13.380
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: Yung professionals ho ng men's, wala po yan eh.

asr-001659
01:54:13.920 --> 01:54:18.640
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: So, but, can I just request, Attorney Eroy, our Executive Director,

asr-001660
01:54:18.800 --> 01:54:23.640
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: siguro lang, Attorney, pakile-explain lang kay chairman, kay Senator Joel, yung definition.

asr-001661
01:54:24.320 --> 01:54:25.420
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: Yung definition natin ng professionals.

asr-001662
01:54:25.820 --> 01:54:28.960
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: Because, sir, kailangan po talaga namin ng tulong to amend this.

asr-001663
01:54:29.420 --> 01:54:35.000
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: But, basically, sir, before I turn over the mic to Attorney Eroy,

asr-001664
01:54:35.760 --> 01:54:43.980
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: yung tungkol po sa pag-review nung whether napapanahon na ba po na ang Philippine Sports Commission maging Department of Youth and Sports,

asr-001665
01:54:44.540 --> 01:54:50.500
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: sa lower house po, sila, Congressman Mike Deed, dalawa po ang sinusulong nila.

asr-001666
01:54:50.500 --> 01:54:54.060
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: Isa po is yung Department of Tourism and Sports.

asr-001667
01:54:54.320 --> 01:55:04.900
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: Kapareho po yan ng Korea, Thailand, Vietnam, and other countries that's good in sports and good in tourism.

asr-001668
01:55:05.320 --> 01:55:08.620
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: The other group naman po is pushing for youth and sports.

asr-001669
01:55:09.020 --> 01:55:13.900
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: Ang sinasabi nila, baka dapat magkasama na talaga si National Youth Council,

asr-001670
01:55:14.340 --> 01:55:16.740
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: tsaka si Philippine Sports Commission.

asr-001671
01:55:16.740 --> 01:55:22.400
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: So, ako po, ang sagot ko lang po dyan,

asr-001672
01:55:24.320 --> 01:55:29.660
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: Chairman, 105 lang po ang empleyado ng PSC.

asr-001673
01:55:30.640 --> 01:55:36.860
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: Wala po kaming regional centers, wala po kaming regional hubs, wala po kami sa mga probinsya.

asr-001674
01:55:36.860 --> 01:55:45.300
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: If I may interrupt po, Chairman, I agree with you, it's high time that we visit itong charter ninyo.

asr-001675
01:55:45.860 --> 01:55:53.540
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Itong PSC charter was created on January 24, 1990, pursuant to Republic Act No. 6847.

asr-001676
01:55:54.320 --> 01:55:56.980
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Otherwise known as the Philippine Sports Commission Act.

asr-001677
01:55:57.840 --> 01:56:00.760
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Kahit na po gawin nating departamento ito, someday,

asr-001678
01:56:01.460 --> 01:56:09.160
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: but ngayon po, nakikita ko yung kailangan na talagang i-revisit itong inyong charter.

asr-001679
01:56:10.160 --> 01:56:15.480
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: At kung hindi pa natin magiging departamento itong PSC,

asr-001680
01:56:16.500 --> 01:56:22.680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: nakikita ko talagang kulang po yung access ng ating mga atleta dahil wala kayong mga regional offices.

asr-001681
01:56:22.680 --> 01:56:31.280
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Tapos, yung mga atlets natin na sa Mindanao, sa Visayas, layo po noon, hirap nga silang mag-travel sa Metro Manila

asr-001682
01:56:31.280 --> 01:56:37.440
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: to avail of your services or yung mga privileges na mula sa PSC.

asr-001683
01:56:38.160 --> 01:56:44.460
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Baka kulang pa yung pamasahin nila, pumunta lang ng Manila sa matatanggap nilang tulong mula sa PSC.

asr-001684
01:56:44.460 --> 01:56:50.260
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: So, dapat po magkaroon talaga kayo ng regional offices.

asr-001685
01:56:51.060 --> 01:56:52.460
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Kaya, i-revisit.

asr-001686
01:56:52.680 --> 01:56:54.680
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: I-revisit po natin itong PSC.

asr-001687
01:56:54.760 --> 01:56:59.840
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Importante po dito na may access po ang ating mga atlets through your regional offices

asr-001688
01:56:59.840 --> 01:57:02.040
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: in which wala kayo ngayon, diba?

asr-001689
01:57:02.820 --> 01:57:08.900
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Wala kayong opisina sa Mindanao, sa Region 13, sa Caraga, Region 12, Region 11.

asr-001690
01:57:09.540 --> 01:57:12.800
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: I think meron lang kayong field office sa Region 11, no?

asr-001691
01:57:13.240 --> 01:57:13.720
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Sa Davao?

asr-001692
01:57:13.720 --> 01:57:15.740
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: Sa Davao po, maliit na opisina.

asr-001693
01:57:15.960 --> 01:57:18.720
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: Tsaka sa Cebu po, because po, nagre-renta kami.

asr-001694
01:57:19.260 --> 01:57:20.840
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: Field office lang po talaga siya.

asr-001695
