PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: 12 years po.

asr-003377
02:46:48.220 --> 02:46:54.340
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: Abandoned yung facility na yan. 12 years po na walang nakatira dyan o hindi mo na gagamit.

asr-003378
02:46:55.120 --> 02:47:02.060
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: Ngayon po, ginagawa na po namin yung renovation ito, Chairman Bong.

asr-003379
02:47:02.780 --> 02:47:05.220
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: It is now the Philippine National Taekwondo Center.

asr-003380
02:47:05.820 --> 02:47:06.640
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: Next slide po.

asr-003381
02:47:07.140 --> 02:47:11.180
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: Ayan na po siya ngayon. Matatapos po siya, second quarter of 2027.

asr-003382
02:47:11.180 --> 02:47:16.980
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: It is the first world-class combat sport facility inside Rizal.

asr-003383
02:47:17.560 --> 02:47:18.180
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: And I'm behind.

asr-003384
02:47:18.220 --> 02:47:23.480
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: Happy to tell you na mismo pong Philippine Taekwondo Association, nagbigay po yan ng 50 million.

asr-003385
02:47:26.480 --> 02:47:31.660
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: 50 million sa Philippine Sports Commission. Para mataguyod na po namin yan.

asr-003386
02:47:31.780 --> 02:47:36.840
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: It is a 180 million facility with close to 2,000 seats capacity.

asr-003387
02:47:36.840 --> 02:47:44.260
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: So yan po lahat. Sira. Dating sira, binabago. Dating sira, pinapaganda. Dating sira, ginagamit muli.

asr-003388
02:47:44.780 --> 02:47:47.000
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: Yan po yung mga projects namin.

asr-003389
02:47:47.340 --> 02:47:48.060
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: Kasama yung mga...

asr-003390
02:47:48.060 --> 02:47:49.920
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: Yung mga very progressive NSAs.

asr-003391
02:47:50.360 --> 02:47:59.900
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: Lahat po ito, proseso na dinadaan namin sa proseso ng NSAs in cooperation and partnership, of course, with the NSAs.

asr-003392
02:47:59.980 --> 02:48:04.180
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: And the guidance of the Commission on Audit po.

asr-003393
02:48:04.560 --> 02:48:05.940
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: So yan po ang example.

asr-003394
02:48:05.940 --> 02:48:17.400
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: So bilang paggawa ka, Mr. Chairman, gusto ko lang po ipaliwanag nga sa inyo na ang aming NEP ngayon is nasa 1.349B.

asr-003395
02:48:18.060 --> 02:48:25.340
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: Sa 2027, talaga pong nagre-request kami ng additional support.

asr-003396
02:48:26.440 --> 02:48:27.980
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: Matagdagan po yung aming GAA.

asr-003397
02:48:28.500 --> 02:48:36.160
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: Just to make sure that we really pursue the support of the development of regional training centers.

asr-003398
02:48:36.160 --> 02:48:39.880
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: Let me, of course, acknowledge the support given by PAGCOR.

asr-003399
02:48:40.240 --> 02:48:45.200
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: Yes, it is true they are already giving us 5% of the revenue every month.

asr-003400
02:48:45.200 --> 02:48:50.820
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: At nagsimula na po yung kanilang pagbayad ng back pay.

asr-003401
02:48:51.320 --> 02:49:01.540
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: Alam po naman natin yan that the PAGCOR has to remit 37 billion to the Philippine Sports Commission in the next 10 years.

asr-003402
02:49:03.560 --> 02:49:10.120
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: And just to put on record, they have given us 1 billion out of 37.

asr-003403
02:49:10.120 --> 02:49:14.120
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: And if we can...

asr-003404
02:49:15.200 --> 02:49:19.640
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: We are talking closely to Chairman Altenco.

asr-003405
02:49:20.020 --> 02:49:28.480
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: As a matter of fact po, may meeting kami mamayang pagkatapos nito para mapag-aralan rin po how to continue the funding.

asr-003406
02:49:28.480 --> 02:49:35.180
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: But in the meantime po, dahil naintindihan rin po naman namin yung pangangailangan at commitments ng PAGCOR,

asr-003407
02:49:35.360 --> 02:49:41.360
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: sana po madagdagan lang po yung aming GAA sa 2027 for the regional training centers, Mr. Chairman.

asr-003408
02:49:41.920 --> 02:49:43.920
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: Maraming salamat po sa inyong lahat.

asr-003409
02:49:44.560 --> 02:49:44.920
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: At...

asr-003410
02:49:44.920 --> 02:49:47.280
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: Good day to everyone.

asr-003411
02:49:50.900 --> 02:49:56.200
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Ang utilization ninyo ngayon sa budget for this year, umusa na po? Ilang percent na?

asr-003412
02:49:56.740 --> 02:49:58.180
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: 97% po.

asr-003413
02:49:59.900 --> 02:50:01.240
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: As of...

asr-003414
02:50:01.240 --> 02:50:04.900
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: As of September po, parang kulag na nga po eh.

asr-003415
02:50:06.320 --> 02:50:07.760
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: Buti na lang dyan yung PAGCOR.

asr-003416
02:50:07.760 --> 02:50:08.280
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Oo.

asr-003417
02:50:13.400 --> 02:50:14.900
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Bilisan mo na sa meeting.

asr-003418
02:50:14.920 --> 02:50:16.820
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Kung nating ninyo sa PAGCOR, pumunta na kayo doon.

asr-003419
02:50:18.740 --> 02:50:22.500
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Nandun yung pera sa PAGCOR.

asr-003420
02:50:23.280 --> 02:50:36.440
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Anyway, before we proceed with the gab, meron lang po tayong isang national athlete rin po na nasa Zoom lang po.

asr-003421
02:50:36.800 --> 02:50:40.400
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Meron siyang question o hinahing.

asr-003422
02:50:40.400 --> 02:50:44.740
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: At gusto ko lang rin po masagot rin po ito ng ating PSC.

asr-003423
02:50:44.920 --> 02:50:51.880
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Meron tayong isang Jiu-Jitsu medalist na rin po na lumapit sa ating opisina na magpapatulong po para ma-follow up sa PSC.

asr-003424
02:50:51.960 --> 02:50:58.040
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Incentive nila na napanalunan noong Jiu-Jitsu World Championship noong August 26.

asr-003425
02:50:58.180 --> 02:51:00.940
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Nandito po si Kimberly Ann Custodio.

asr-003426
02:51:01.800 --> 02:51:04.800
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: Ah, yeah. Kimberly, si Chairman Patupo ito.

asr-003427
02:51:05.780 --> 02:51:09.240
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: Yes, pinoproseso na namin yung incentives nyo.

asr-003428
02:51:09.240 --> 02:51:14.240
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: But just to put on record that yung pag-submit ho ng record...

asr-003429
02:51:14.920 --> 02:51:19.400
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: Records ng NSA sa PSC ay ginawa lang po noong October 1.

asr-003430
02:51:20.080 --> 02:51:26.620
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: So, in the next few weeks, hopefully in the next few days, i-release na po namin yan.

asr-003431
02:51:27.160 --> 02:51:31.560
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: Pero yung event po na nanalo kayo, congratulations po. Ito ay huling August.

asr-003432
02:51:32.080 --> 02:51:40.700
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: Pero yung sinubmit po sa amin ng inyong federation is officially last October 1 only.

asr-003433
02:51:40.700 --> 02:51:44.700
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: So, I assure you, pagdating sa incentives...

asr-003434
02:51:44.920 --> 02:51:52.040
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: Talaga, kung hindi namin pinagdadamot yan, as a matter of fact, even the youth athletes get more than what they expect

asr-003435
02:51:52.040 --> 02:51:58.500
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: and more than any amount they have expected in their young career,

asr-003436
02:52:00.240 --> 02:52:01.160
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: hindi po ano yan.

asr-003437
02:52:02.500 --> 02:52:08.900
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: Yan po ay may pondo, yan po ay laging nakalaan, lagi pong nakasubaybay ang pag-core dyan.

asr-003438
02:52:09.460 --> 02:52:12.580
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: So, matatanggap mo na yan kasi pinoproseso na namin yan.

asr-003439
02:52:12.580 --> 02:52:13.580
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: So, thank you for...

asr-003440
02:52:14.920 --> 02:52:17.080
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: Thank you for informing us about that delay.

asr-003441
02:52:17.480 --> 02:52:21.060
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: But like what I always say, and let it be very clear to everyone,

asr-003442
02:52:22.480 --> 02:52:30.280
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: kami po ay makakapagtrabaho nung mabilis kung yung counterpart NSA po namin ay mabilis din.

asr-003443
02:52:31.040 --> 02:52:40.900
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: Dahil kung ang counterpart NSA po namin ay hindi mabilis, kami po ay matiteknikal pagbilisan namin yung isang hindi pa sinasubmit sa amin.

asr-003444
02:52:41.320 --> 02:52:42.140
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: Sana po maunaw.

asr-003451
02:55:23.530 --> 02:55:44.900
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: Bong Go, I'll make a brief presentation to introduce the Games and Amusements Board to the body. The Games and Amusements Board is the agency in charge of regulating and supervising professional sports in the Philippines. Oftentimes, it is mistaken for its bigger cousin, which is called the Philippine Sports Commission.

asr-003452
02:55:44.920 --> 02:55:55.440
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: The Games and Amusements Board currently supervises a total of 17 non-contact sports and 6 contact sports.

asr-003453
02:55:56.560 --> 02:56:04.760
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: The Games and Amusements Board, in the course of supervising and regulating professional sports, collects regulatory fees.

asr-003454
02:56:05.820 --> 02:56:10.560
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: In 2025, it collected a total of 30 million pesos.

asr-003455
02:56:10.560 --> 02:56:14.560
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: Aside from regulating and supervising professional sports,

asr-003456
02:56:14.920 --> 02:56:23.900
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: the Games and Amusements Board is also in charge of the betting aspect of horse racing and the licensing of international derbies.

asr-003457
02:56:24.680 --> 02:56:32.760
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: It also undertakes law enforcement operations in coordination with the Philippine National Police and the National Bureau of Investigation.

asr-003458
02:56:33.760 --> 02:56:40.920
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: In 2025, the GAMS operations led to the arrest of a total of 194 persons,

asr-003459
02:56:40.920 --> 02:56:42.880
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: out of whom,

asr-003460
02:56:43.320 --> 02:56:44.920
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: 145 were charged,

asr-003461
02:56:44.920 --> 02:56:51.320
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: This year, the GAMS operations led to the arrest of 14 persons,

asr-003462
02:56:51.840 --> 02:56:52.500
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: out of whom,

asr-003463
02:56:52.740 --> 02:56:54.080
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: 6 were charged in court.

asr-003464
02:56:55.480 --> 02:56:57.220
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: For 2026,

asr-003465
02:56:58.640 --> 02:57:01.740
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: the GAMS priority programs include

asr-003466
02:57:01.740 --> 02:57:04.920
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: the continuing education of its licensees,

asr-003467
02:57:06.820 --> 02:57:10.900
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: the Games and Amusements Board for this purpose organized seminars.

asr-003468
02:57:10.900 --> 02:57:12.580
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: With respect to boxing,

asr-003469
02:57:13.260 --> 02:57:14.900
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: these seminars involved sports,

asr-003470
02:57:15.060 --> 02:57:15.640
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: training,

asr-003471
02:57:16.280 --> 02:57:16.780
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: and

asr-003472
02:57:17.280 --> 02:57:19.080
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: nutrition and conditioning.

asr-003473
02:57:19.620 --> 02:57:21.540
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: It has been observed that

asr-003474
02:57:21.540 --> 02:57:23.140
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: our Filipino boxers

asr-003475
02:57:23.140 --> 02:57:25.480
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: are already competent

asr-003476
02:57:25.480 --> 02:57:27.500
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: in terms of their skill

asr-003477
02:57:27.500 --> 02:57:30.080
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: and they can become world champions.

asr-003478
02:57:30.680 --> 02:57:31.000
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: However,

asr-003479
02:57:31.680 --> 02:57:32.400
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: it is

asr-003480
02:57:32.400 --> 02:57:35.720
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: rough.

asr-003481
02:57:36.480 --> 02:57:36.880
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: So,

asr-003482
02:57:37.020 --> 02:57:38.260
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: to address this,

asr-003483
02:57:38.700 --> 02:57:41.060
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: we have seminars on nutrition and conditioning.

asr-003484
02:57:42.160 --> 02:57:43.980
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: The Games and Amusements Board

asr-003485
02:57:43.980 --> 02:57:44.900
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: is also gonna be for the next season.

asr-003486
02:57:44.920 --> 02:57:46.760
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: for an ISO accreditation.

asr-003487
02:57:47.960 --> 02:57:48.940
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: With this move,

asr-003488
02:57:49.200 --> 02:57:50.520
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: the Games and Amusements Board

asr-003489
02:57:50.520 --> 02:57:53.040
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: seeks to

asr-003490
02:57:53.040 --> 02:57:53.500
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: elevate

asr-003491
02:57:53.500 --> 02:58:00.620
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: its procedures and processes

asr-003492
02:58:00.620 --> 02:58:02.700
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: up to international standards.

asr-003493
02:58:04.100 --> 02:58:05.240
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: And finally,

asr-003494
02:58:05.440 --> 02:58:06.620
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: the Games and Amusements Board

asr-003495
02:58:06.620 --> 02:58:08.800
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: is currently crafting its

asr-003496
02:58:08.800 --> 02:58:10.900
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: rules of procedure. The aim is

asr-003497
02:58:10.900 --> 02:58:13.000
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: to afford our stakeholders

asr-003498
02:58:13.000 --> 02:58:14.820
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: a speedy and an

asr-003499
02:58:14.820 --> 02:58:16.880
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: inexpensive determination of their

asr-003500
02:58:16.880 --> 02:58:18.260
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: administrative cases.

asr-003501
02:58:19.600 --> 02:58:20.740
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: The National

asr-003502
02:58:20.740 --> 02:58:22.980
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: Expenditure Program proposes

asr-003503
02:58:22.980 --> 02:58:25.280
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: a budget of P175

asr-003504
02:58:25.280 --> 02:58:26.800
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: million for the

asr-003505
02:58:26.800 --> 02:58:28.640
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: Games and Amusements Board.

asr-003506
02:58:29.520 --> 02:58:30.740
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: We pray that after

asr-003507
02:58:30.740 --> 02:58:33.080
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: due consideration, the proposed

asr-003508
02:58:33.080 --> 02:58:34.240
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: budget be approved.

asr-003509
02:58:34.800 --> 02:58:35.220
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: Thank you.

asr-003510
02:58:42.900 --> 02:58:44.420
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: I would like to speak

asr-003511
02:58:44.420 --> 02:58:44.800
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: to the

asr-003512
02:58:44.800 --> 02:59:05.320
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: GAB, yung napag-usapan kanina, yung game fixing, baka ma-address ninyo ito. It's been a problem ever since. Baka hindi lang po sa basketball. Silipin ninyo po nang mabuti. Trabaho ninyo naman po iyon.

asr-003513
02:59:05.320 --> 02:59:08.800
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: Yes, Senator Bong.

asr-003514
02:59:08.800 --> 02:59:11.520
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: And some questions lang po. What measures does the GAB currently implement

asr-003515
02:59:11.520 --> 02:59:12.620
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: to protect the rights

asr-003516
02:59:12.620 --> 02:59:13.880
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: and welfare of professional

asr-003517
02:59:13.880 --> 02:59:14.660
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: athletes?

asr-003518
02:59:14.800 --> 02:59:24.700
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: At present, Senator Bong, we are

asr-003519
02:59:24.700 --> 02:59:38.180
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: Assured that before they are penalized or before they get disciplined, they'll be afforded their full right to due process of law

asr-003520
02:59:38.180 --> 02:59:54.700
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: About some medical insurance, yung gabho ba require professional sports promoters, leagues, and organizers to provide medical insurance or accident coverage to participating athletes?

asr-003521
02:59:57.560 --> 03:00:00.020
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: Yes, Senator. For example,

asr-003522
03:00:00.000 --> 03:00:11.580
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: For example, for motorsports, the Games and Amusements Board requires that before we license a player, he must first submit an insurance coverage.

asr-003523
03:00:11.580 --> 03:00:30.660
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: But this requirement is meeting with a lot of difficulties because our insurance companies generally do not cover risks involving professional athletes, especially on sports that are considered risky, like motorsports and boxing.

asr-003524
03:00:33.520 --> 03:00:37.080
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: Wala namang reklamo itong mga professional athletes natin.

asr-003525
03:00:37.900 --> 03:00:41.260
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: Our professional athletes guaranteed timely payouts.

asr-003526
03:00:41.580 --> 03:00:50.280
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: Payment of their salaries, yung kanilang fight purses, yung prices, and other contractual compensation.

asr-003527
03:00:51.220 --> 03:00:57.340
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: So far, Senator, we haven't received this year any complaint for non-payment of salaries.

asr-003528
03:00:57.640 --> 03:01:09.140
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: Now, last year, there were complaints involving basketball players, but those complaints were withdrawn and it appears to us that they were addressed by their teams.

asr-003529
03:01:10.420 --> 03:01:11.420
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: A question.

asr-003530
03:01:11.580 --> 03:01:21.140
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Chairman Pato, itong sa volleyball, basketball, meron tayong PBA, sanctioned by the GAB.

asr-003531
03:01:22.300 --> 03:01:27.800
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Sa volleyball naman, we have this Philippine Volleyball League, sa Women's.

asr-003532
03:01:27.800 --> 03:01:28.540
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: Premier Volleyball League.

asr-003533
03:01:28.640 --> 03:01:31.600
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Premier Volleyball League. Sa inyo po yun?

asr-003534
03:01:32.140 --> 03:01:33.200
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: Yes, Senator Bong.

asr-003535
03:01:33.500 --> 03:01:35.560
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Sa inyo sila kumukuha ng lisensya?

asr-003536
03:01:35.880 --> 03:01:36.500
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: Yes, Senator Bong.

asr-003537
03:01:36.500 --> 03:01:40.500
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Sanction nyo po sila during games, nandiyo dyan kayo, you attend, you witness.

asr-003538
03:01:41.580 --> 03:01:42.520
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: Yes, Senator Bong.

asr-003539
03:01:43.520 --> 03:01:49.380
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: How about this sa men's volleyball? Kasi wala silang professional.

asr-003540
03:01:49.380 --> 03:02:10.380
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: So ano pwedeng ma-explain nyo po sa ating mga kababayan, including Chairman Pato, ano ho bang pinakaiba na ngayon sa women's volleyball with the men's since walang professional yung men's.

asr-003541
03:02:10.380 --> 03:02:21.900
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: And then yung kanilang mga matatanggap sa inyo, sa PSC, na tulong since they are now professionals.

asr-003542
03:02:24.220 --> 03:02:25.840
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: Yes, Senator Bong.

asr-003543
03:02:26.480 --> 03:02:31.160
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: The PSC and the Games and Amusements Board have a joint resolution.

asr-003544
03:02:31.840 --> 03:02:39.080
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: In that resolution, we demarcate the line between professionals as against non-professionals.

asr-003545
03:02:39.080 --> 03:03:01.920
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: Now, the general definition of a professional is one who participates in a sporting event, and in that participation he's paid a sum of money, either a salary or as a prize. Now, if you're paid a sum of money for participating in a sporting event

asr-003580
03:03:01.920 --> 03:03:02.940
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: as a professional.

asr-003581
03:03:04.880 --> 03:03:09.900
GAB Chairperson Atty. Francisco J. Rivera: That's the definition of who constitutes a professional athlete.

asr-003582
03:03:09.900 --> 03:03:36.580
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: So wala na sa PSC, wala na silang natatanggap sa na-allowances and benefits from PSC since they are now nasa Pro League na po sila, kahit na nag-represent sila sa country. Ano yung matatanggap pa rin nila sa inyo sa PSC since they are representing the country even though they are professionals?

asr-003583
03:03:36.580 --> 03:04:06.560
PSC OIC Executive Director Atty. Guillermo B. Iroy Jr.: Good afternoon, Chairman. Professional players, when they represent the country in international competition through the National Sports Association, are still able to receive what amateur athletes get, for example free airfare, accommodation, allowances, and training requirements, just like the volleyball players when they participated in the Southeast Asian Games.

asr-003584
03:04:06.580 --> 03:04:29.700
PSC OIC Executive Director Atty. Guillermo B. Iroy Jr.: In the Pro League, they requested, this is volleyball, sir, they requested for an allowance. The board approved. In fact, at the time, the volleyball is under POC. So for as long as the professional player, whatever sports they are, they will be endorsed by the National Sports Federation to represent the country in international competition.

asr-003585
03:04:29.700 --> 03:04:36.560
PSC OIC Executive Director Atty. Guillermo B. Iroy Jr.: They can receive allowances and other expenses that required for the team.

asr-003586
03:04:36.580 --> 03:04:53.980
PSC OIC Executive Director Atty. Guillermo B. Iroy Jr.: To participate in the international competition. Especially next year, if you, for the information of the chair, I think of all the sports now, only wrestling has no professional competition.

asr-003587
03:04:54.540 --> 03:05:06.520
PSC OIC Executive Director Atty. Guillermo B. Iroy Jr.: That is the only remaining sports that is amateur in nature. But the rest of the sports from athletics up to in PAC, even boobinam, they have professional sports already.

asr-003588
03:05:06.580 --> 03:05:17.040
PSC OIC Executive Director Atty. Guillermo B. Iroy Jr.: So right now, the only thing that we cannot fund is when they represent the club. But if they represent the country, the PSC can still fund them.

asr-003589
03:05:17.240 --> 03:05:19.700
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Wala na silang regular monthly allowances no more?

asr-003590
03:05:20.460 --> 03:05:29.800
PSC OIC Executive Director Atty. Guillermo B. Iroy Jr.: Wala silang monthly allowances, sir, because for example, the volleyball women, they were not endorsed to us by the Federation for allowances.

asr-003591
03:05:30.840 --> 03:05:36.440
PSC OIC Executive Director Atty. Guillermo B. Iroy Jr.: However, if they represent the country, they are endorsed for allowances at the same time.

asr-003592
03:05:36.580 --> 03:05:37.040
PSC OIC Executive Director Atty. Guillermo B. Iroy Jr.: We approve.

asr-003593
03:05:37.340 --> 03:05:39.640
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: So yung nag-compete sila sa Asian Games, meron?

asr-003594
03:05:39.800 --> 03:05:40.380
PSC OIC Executive Director Atty. Guillermo B. Iroy Jr.: Meron, sir.

asr-003595
03:05:41.000 --> 03:05:43.520
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Anong duration lang po ang pano nila?

asr-003596
03:05:43.880 --> 03:05:54.480
PSC OIC Executive Director Atty. Guillermo B. Iroy Jr.: Depende sa kanilang, for example, they go into camp for two weeks, the NEC requested, it will be approved for as long as it related to the international competition.

asr-003597
03:05:55.680 --> 03:05:57.520
PSC OIC Executive Director Atty. Guillermo B. Iroy Jr.: For example, Asian Games.

asr-003598
03:05:57.520 --> 03:06:06.520
PSC OIC Executive Director Atty. Guillermo B. Iroy Jr.: I think one of the reason this volleyball issue came up because every time they go to international competition, they have at least one month or two.

asr-003599
03:06:06.580 --> 03:06:08.200
PSC OIC Executive Director Atty. Guillermo B. Iroy Jr.: Two weeks training camp.

asr-003600
03:06:08.740 --> 03:06:13.220
PSC OIC Executive Director Atty. Guillermo B. Iroy Jr.: And I think it was not endorsed to us by the Federation at that time.

asr-003601
03:06:13.300 --> 03:06:15.260
PSC OIC Executive Director Atty. Guillermo B. Iroy Jr.: And I think those are some of the issues that we're going to...

asr-003602
